╭─╭ keys ────────────────────────────────────────────────╮─╮
│ │ → / n        step one cycle                          │ │
│ │ ←            step back one cycle                     │ │
│ │ space        run / pause                             │ │
│ │ + / -        faster / slower (also ] and [)          │ │
│ │ f            fast mode: full speed, no animation     │ │
│ │ ↑ ↓ / j k    select a source line                    │ │
│ │ b            breakpoint on the selected line         │ │
│›│ r            reset to cycle 0                        │ │
│ │ a            assemble again (reloads the file)       │ │
│c│ tab / t      Pipeline or Registers + memory          │ │
╰─│ h            registers in hex or decimal             │─╯
╭ │ g / G        memory: data or stack                   │─╮
│>│ PgUp / PgDn  memory: scroll a page                   │ │
│L│ s            pick a sample program                   │ │
│A│ /            type a command, e.g. /open, /serve      │ │
│✓│ ?            this help (any key closes it)           │ │
│ │ q            quit                                    │ │
╰─│                                                      │─╯
